---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  canonical="index.html"
  title="Suites With Keith | Better Rooms. Better Trips."
  description="Better Rooms. Better Trips. Hotel recommendations from an advisor who tours the rooms before recommending them — Europe, honeymoons, and hotels worth the airfare. Booking is complimentary."
  preload="/images/personal/gundari-sunset.jpg"
  navOverlay={true}
>

<!-- 1 · The claim -->
<header class="hero hero--video">
  <video class="hero-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="metadata"
    poster="/images/personal/gundari-sunset.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
    <source src="https://cdn.sceneai.art/Hero Section Video/01d1f8de-fec0-4bf5-8b48-9fc2dbc8c6b0.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Issue No. 02 &middot; Napa &amp; Sonoma &middot; lands September 15</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl">Better rooms.<br><em>Better trips.</em></h1>
    <p class="sub">Hotel recommendations from someone who&rsquo;s stood in the rooms &mdash; 123 on file across four continents, 38 of them toured in a single spring. Booking is complimentary; the judgment comes with it.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#inquire" data-gtag-label="start_planning" data-gtag-location="hero">Tell me where you&rsquo;re going</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-shadow" href="/featured-destinations.html" data-gtag-label="see_destinations" data-gtag-location="hero" style="border-color:rgba(242,239,230,.4); color:var(--band-ink);">See the destinations</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <span class="hero-cue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</header>

<!-- 2 · The evidence -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The evidence</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Counted, and on file</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger reveal">
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">123</span><span class="d"><b>Hotels on file</b> &mdash; researched, compared and written up across Europe, the islands, Asia, Africa and the Americas, from Aman Kyoto to Er&emacr;ma on Milos. The ones I&rsquo;ve slept in say so.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">38</span><span class="d"><b>Toured and stayed in four weeks, most recently</b> &mdash; the Cyclades, eight islands, solo, room by room. Every destination I recommend gets this treatment sooner or later; Greece was simply this spring&rsquo;s trip.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">02</span><span class="d"><b>Collections &mdash; the second lands September 15.</b> Issue No. 01, Greece, in print now; Issue No. 02, Napa &amp; Sonoma, on the way. The field notes behind the recommendations.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3 · The judgment -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The judgment</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Santorini or Mykonos?</h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:44ch;">The Cyclades&rsquo; two headliners, and the first question every Greece trip has to answer. No hotel will pick a side. I will &mdash; it takes about thirty seconds.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="choose reveal">
      <a class="choose-col" href="/santorini-vs-mykonos.html" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Choose Santorini</span>
        <h3>If the caldera is the reason you&rsquo;re coming</h3>
        <p class="lead">Two or three nights in a cave suite on the cliff &mdash; the classic picture, and it earns its reputation. Make it the finale of the route, not the start.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="choose-col" href="/santorini-vs-mykonos.html" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Choose Mykonos</span>
        <h3>If you want range &mdash; the loud island and the quiet one</h3>
        <p class="lead">The island that surprised me most &mdash; some of the best hotels, meals and service of my entire Cyclades trip. Beach clubs by day, serious tables at night.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:26px;"><a href="/santorini-vs-mykonos.html" style="font-size:.74rem; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--brass); text-decoration:none;">Read the full head-to-head &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4 · The advocacy -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Same rate &mdash; sometimes better</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">You can book the room.<br>You can&rsquo;t make them know you.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal adv-grid">
      <p class="story-quote">&ldquo;With less than 24 hours&rsquo; notice we needed a hotel in Saint-Tropez in peak season. Keith stepped in with the perfect recommendation &mdash; and personally contacted the hotel before our arrival. <b>When we pulled up, the staff greeted us by name</b>, welcomed us with cold towels, and surprised us with a complimentary upgrade.&rdquo;</p>
      <div>
        <p class="attr">Tyler &amp; Spencer C. &middot; COMO Le Beauvallon &middot; Saint-Tropez</p>
        <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:20px; max-width:52ch;">The rate through me is the one you&rsquo;d pay booking direct &mdash; sometimes better. What changes is who calls the hotel before you arrive, and who answers while you&rsquo;re there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5 · The Collection -->
<section class="section" id="collection">
  <div class="container collection-grid">
    <div class="sec-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Greece Collection &middot; Issue No. 01</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The field notes, in print</h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:40ch;">A firsthand journal of the Cyclades &mdash; 38 hotels, seven destination guides, and the research behind every verdict on this site.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:26px;"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/greece-collection.html">Read Issue No. 01</a></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0; max-width:520px;">
      <img src="/images/personal/greece-collection-cover-mockup.jpg" alt="The Greece Collection, Issue No. 01 — printed magazine" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(22,23,18,.18);" />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6 · The range -->
<section class="section" id="range">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The destinations</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Where I plan most often</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards four reveal">
      <a class="card" href="/best-hotels-greece.html">
        <img src="/images/islands/santorini-hero.jpg" alt="The caldera at Santorini" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">The Cyclades</span><h3>Greece</h3><p>Eight islands toured this spring &mdash; my ten favorite hotels, ranked.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/featured-destinations.html#italy">
        <img src="/images/proposals/lake-como/passalacqua/garden-lake.jpg" alt="Gardens meeting the water at Passalacqua, Lake Como" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">Como to the Amalfi Coast</span><h3>Italy</h3><p>The hotels I book from Lake Como to Positano.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/napa-sonoma.html">
        <img src="/images/napa/madrona.jpg" alt="The Madrona, Sonoma wine country" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">Wine country</span><h3>Napa &amp; Sonoma</h3><p>Nine hotels, ranked from personal stays.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/featured-destinations.html#mexico">
        <img src="/images/personal/montage-cabo.jpg" alt="Montage Los Cabos on Santa Maria Bay" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">Cabo &amp; Punta Mita</span><h3>Mexico</h3><p>The Pacific-coast resorts I send clients to first.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:26px;"><a href="/destination-guides.html" style="font-size:.74rem; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--brass); text-decoration:none;" data-gtag-label="all_guides" data-gtag-location="range">All destinations &amp; guides &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7 · The ask -->
<section class="section inquire" id="inquire">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">One question</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Where and when?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:38ch;">&ldquo;Santorini in June&rdquo; is a complete answer. I&rsquo;ll take it from there.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Website Inquiry" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="index" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when">Where and when?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="Santorini in June" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name">And where do I send the recommendation?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
        <label for="q-details" style="margin-top:2px;">Anything else? Nights, budget, occasion &mdash; optional</label>
        <input id="q-details" type="text" name="details" placeholder="7 nights &middot; around $1,500/night &middot; anniversary" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Send</button>
      <p class="note">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .collection-grid { display: grid; gap: 44px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: center; }
  .adv-grid { display: grid; gap: 40px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .collection-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .collection-grid figure { justify-self: center; }
    .adv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; align-items: end; column-gap: 64px; }
  }
</style>
